 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "My Contract Husband Resembles the Male Protagonist"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "계약 남편이 남자 주인공과 닮았다"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Enya Lockhart remembers that she reincarnated into a terrible novel she once read, nicknamed Empress Impisonment. Knowing that she's fated to marry the emperor, a terrible person, she aims to avoid marriage to save her life.\n\nShe enters into a one-year contract marriage to a mercenary named Dale, in order to break off an engagement with the emperor.\n\nUnlike the original emperor in the novel, Dale is pure, innocent, and kind.\n\nOne day, she found herself thinking...\n\n\"If I were to truly marry, it should be someone like him.\"\n\nAnd then — something happened."
  },
